SLIDE 2 — WHY ARE WE CHANGING?
==================================================

Title:
"Current Challenge: Dashboard Freshness Depends on DB Refresh"

Explain the current situation in simple business language.

Current source model:
- Dashboard metrics come from DB aggregation only.
- Data is derived through Transaction_Inbound / Transaction_Outbound.
- DashboardDao + dashboard.xml are used.

Current request flow:
UI → GET /dashboard → DashboardService → DB/Cache → UI

Current limitation:
- No dedicated live event consumer path.
- Dashboard freshness depends on DB/cache refresh timing.
- Near-real-time stage movement is not immediately visible.
- Normal polling can result in repeated DB reads.

